Error [E0003]: `.Rect{…}` mixes a positional entry with field names
  --> named_pattern_mixed_positions.jet:8:18
    |
  8 |         .Rect{w, _} -> w
    |                  ^
 Why: A named-field pattern labels every entry; one pattern uses one form
 Fix: Write `field: pattern` for this entry, or match by position with `.Rect(…)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

Error [E0003]: Expected a call, binding, assignment, or `return`, found `->`
  --> named_pattern_mixed_positions.jet:8:21
    |
  8 |         .Rect{w, _} -> w
    |                     ^^
 Why: Inside a function body, write a call, binding, assignment, or `return`
 Fix: e.g. print("hello") or x :: 1
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

Error [E0003]: This line computes a value but doesn't do anything with it
  --> named_pattern_mixed_positions.jet:9:17
    |
  9 |         .Circle{r} -> r
    |                 ^
 Why: Only calls, bindings, assignments, and `return` are allowed here
 Fix: Use the value, e.g. `x :: ...` or `print(...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

